格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugins: control a local DeepSeek Harness from your phone — tailscale point-to-point or your own VPS relay. One entry point: dsh --profile mobile","id":"gh:1333629454","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-harness-mobile-solution","slug":"BB-84C/deepseek-harness-mobile-solution","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","tailscale"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugins: control a local DeepSeek Harness from your phone — tailscale point-to-point or your own"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" VPS relay. One entry point: dsh --profile mobile"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# `dsh` Mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"### Control your local DeepSeek Harness from any remote device"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"This project adds a remote control plane and two transports:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Tailscale** — point-to-point over your tailnet.\n- **VPS relay** — If you happen to have your own"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" VPS, use your VPS as relay. One relay, many machines, one menu."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Both serve the same thing: the official dsh web UI through an authenticating gateway."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This is a **dsh plugin** — installed with the stock plugin manager, controlled through one entry poi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s is a **dsh plugin** — installed with the stock plugin manager, controlled through one entry point:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Everything lives behind **`dsh --profile mobile`** — `service`, `tailscale`, `relay`, `device`, `con"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"fig`, `status`, `doctor`, `logs`, `update`, `uninstall`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Package | Profile | Role |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `@bb-84c/dsh-mobile-cli` | `mobile` | command family |\n| `@bb-84c/dsh-mobile-server` | `web` | gat"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"eway + transports + session hydration |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"📖 `docs/plugin-install.md`"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **dsh**: verified on `0.1.0-rc.6`, `0.2.1-rc.2` and `0.2.1-rc.5`. The gateway adapts to both sides"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" of dsh's browser-token gate (`0.1.2-rc.1`+), so newer releases normally work unchanged.\n- **Node.js"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"**: ≥ 22 (the relay is zero-dependency).\n- `dsh --profile mobile doctor` prints your dsh version and"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" whether it is on the verified list.\n- After upgrading dsh, run the 10-minute checklist in `docs/res"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"earch/upstream-touchpoints.md`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- One entry point: `dsh --profile mobile <command>`\n- Official UI, unchanged — official updates reac"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"h your phone automatically\n- Device auth: one-time pairing codes, token hashes only, instant revocat"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ion\n- Live streaming over SSE/WS, tunneled end-to-end\n- Instance menu at your relay domain\n- One res"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ident instance enforced; pidfile-guarded stop/restart\n- Three-OS scripts, auto-start templates\n- 156"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" enforced; pidfile-guarded stop/restart\n- Three-OS scripts, auto-start templates\n- 156 offline tests"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- dsh web stays loopback-only, as shipped.\n- The gateway plugin lives inside the same dsh process an"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"d proxies the official UI.\n- The relay is a standalone zero-dependency Node service. It stores crede"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ntial hashes and a machine directory — never session data."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Modes"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Tailscale"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"📖 `docs/deployment/tailscale.md`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### VPS relay"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open `https://relay.example.com`, pick a machine, pair, done."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"📖 `docs/deployment/relay.md`"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## For dsh agents"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Setting this up for a user? Read in order, then execute:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"1. `docs/plugin-install.md` — install the plugins.\n2. `docs/deployment/tailscale.md` or `docs/deploy"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ment/relay.md` — set up a transport. Relay mode also needs the relay on a VPS (`scripts/relay-deploy"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"`).\n3. `docs/commands.md` — command reference.\n4. Pair: `dsh --profile mobile device pair --name <na"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"me>`. Verify with `docs/acceptance.md`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Rules:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- Never patch the shipped `@deepseek-ai/*` packages.\n- Exactly one resident dsh web instance per `$D"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"SH_HOME`.\n- Stop/restart only through the CLI.\n- Keep tokens out of logs and chat.\n- After an offici"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"al dsh upgrade, run `docs/research/upstream-touchpoints.md`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Repository"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- Web server stays loopback-only; the gateway is the only network surface.\n- Tailscale mode rides Wi"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"reGuard; relay mode is HTTPS behind Caddy.\n- Pairing codes are single-use, 5-minute expiry. Tokens a"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"re stored hashed, verified in constant time, revoked instantly.\n- Relay stores credential hashes and"},{"id":"p38s4","text":" a public directory only."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Doc | Audience |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `docs/plugin-install.md` | users |\n| `docs/commands.md` | users |\n| `docs/deployment/service.md` |"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" users |\n| `docs/deployment/tailscale.md` | users |\n| `docs/deployment/relay.md` | users |\n| `docs/a"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"cceptance.md` | users & agents |\n| `docs/plan.md` | project |\n| `docs/research/` | project & agents "},{"id":"p41s4","text":"|\n| `docs/specs/` | app implementors |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- A machine running DeepSeek Harness that stays online.\n- Node.js ≥ 22.\n- Tailscale **or** a small V"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" machine running DeepSeek Harness that stays online.\n- Node.js ≥ 22.\n- Tailscale **or** a small VPS."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
